  "title": "GC outer lower band: yearly excursion paths",
  "summary": "Next-open GC excursions after a close below the outer lower EMA band vary by year. The saved default grid is descriptive; excursion extrema are not executable exits.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-06T23:09:36Z",
